  "Splash": "an off-colour single-pip card the pool already has fixing for",
  "early_creatures": "fills a early creatures slot the deck still lacks against top players' decks in the pair",
  "late_creatures": "fills a late creatures slot the deck still lacks against top players' decks in the pair",
