  "landcycling": "fills a landcycling slot the deck still lacks against top players' decks in the pair",
  "finishers": "fills a finisher slot (five-plus drop a SD above the set's mean win rate) the deck still lacks",
  "fixing": "fills a fixing slot (dual land, fixer) the deck still lacks against top players' decks in the pair",
  "pressure": "fills a pressure slot (power above toughness, haste, or evasive with power 2+) the deck still lacks",
